text = "[center][b]1. Study[/b]
You'll be given an ID, study it like your life depends on it (it does).
[font_size=90] [/font_size][b]2. Wait[/b][font_size=90] [/font_size]
A timer counts down, better use that time wisely.
[font_size=90] [/font_size][b]3. Get Cooked[/b][font_size=90] [/font_size]
When the timer hits zero, you will get asked questions. Don't answer wrong.
[font_size=75] [/font_size][b][i]Score points through time and accuracy.[/i][/b][font_size=75] [/font_size]"

